1
00:00:00,908 --> 00:00:03,408
(Howard:)Don't you just hate
when this happens?

2
00:00:05,371 --> 00:00:06,581
(Bernadette:)Wow.

3
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:13,500
(Sheldon:)All right, how's this for revenge?

4
00:00:13,713 --> 00:00:19,923
(Sheldon:)A solution of hydrogen peroxide
and one of saturated potassium iodide.

5
00:00:20,094 --> 00:00:22,934
(Raj:)-What's this?
-Mountain Dew.

6
00:00:25,391 --> 00:00:27,431
(Sheldon:)Ah. Refreshing.

7
00:00:27,602 --> 00:00:30,942
(Sheldon:)Now, we're going to combine these
chemicals with ordinary dish soap...

8
00:00:31,105 --> 00:00:35,155
(Sheldon:)...creating a little exothermic release
of oxygen.

9
00:00:38,404 --> 00:00:40,904
[CHUCKLING]

10
00:00:46,829 --> 00:00:49,459
(Raj:)-Foamy vengeance.
-Yes, exactly.

11
00:00:49,624 --> 00:00:51,294
(Leonard:)This is brilliant, Sheldon.

12
00:00:51,459 --> 00:00:53,629
How are we gonna deploy it
in Kripke's office?

13
00:00:53,794 --> 00:00:58,024
(Sheldon:)Already taken care of. Observe.

